{"id":"1b27c625bb944c27","group":"20","path":"20/20-ex-tm-plus-three.md","title":"原书加三机器及其停止输出","display":"ex-tm-plus-three — 原书加三机器及其停止输出","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-ex-tm-plus-three","aliases":["20-ex-tm-plus-three"],"display":"ex-tm-plus-three — 原书加三机器及其停止输出","chapter":"1","section":"1.4","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"式 (1.1)；§1.4 的计算例子","source_printed_pages":[8,9],"source_pdf_pages":[44,45],"depends_on":["[[20-df-tmcomp]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-ex-tm-plus-three"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-ex-tm-plus-three</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-tm-plus-three — 原书加三机器及其停止输出"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"式 (1.1)；§1.4 的计算例子"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>8</span><span>9</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>44</span><span>45</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"04aa1148d91b88f8\" href=\"?note=04aa1148d91b88f8\" title=\"20-df-tmcomp\">20-df-tmcomp</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q=\\{0,1,2\\}\">\\(Q=\\{0,1,2\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\{\\sqcup,1\\}\">\\(S=\\{\\sqcup,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\omega\">\\(x\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"04aa1148d91b88f8\" href=\"?note=04aa1148d91b88f8\" title=\"20-df-tmcomp\">20-df-tmcomp</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}tm\\text{-}plus\\text{-}three}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\\delta=\\{((1,1),(1,1,+1)),((1,\\sqcup),(2,1,+1)),((2,\\sqcup),(0,1,+1))\\},\\\\ M=(Q,S,\\delta,1,0),\\qquad M(x)\\downarrow=x+3.\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}tm\\text{-}plus\\text{-}three}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\\delta=\\{((1,1),(1,1,+1)),((1,\\sqcup),(2,1,+1)),((2,\\sqcup),(0,1,+1))\\},\\\\ M=(Q,S,\\delta,1,0),\\qquad M(x)\\downarrow=x+3.\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>读头先越过输入的 x+1 个 1，再在两个相邻空白格各写一个 1，进入状态 0。共 x+3 步后磁带有 x+3 个 1，读头位于下一空白格。特别地输入 0 输出 3，输入 2 输出 5。该例直接检验停止输出不能要求头下为 1。</p>\n<p>来源：式 (1.1)；§1.4 的计算例子；印刷页 8, 9；PDF 第 44, 45 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-tmcomp","status":"resolved","id":"04aa1148d91b88f8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tmcomp]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tmcomp","status":"resolved","id":"04aa1148d91b88f8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tmcomp]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"Q=\\{0,1,2\\}","display":false},{"tex":"S=\\{\\sqcup,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}tm\\text{-}plus\\text{-}three}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\\delta=\\{((1,1),(1,1,+1)),((1,\\sqcup),(2,1,+1)),((2,\\sqcup),(0,1,+1))\\},\\\\ M=(Q,S,\\delta,1,0),\\qquad M(x)\\downarrow=x+3.\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1275,"backlinks":[{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-ex-tm-plus-three]] — 章 1；直接提供者 1 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-ex-tm-plus-three]]"}],"outgoing":["04aa1148d91b88f8"]}